    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "HippoRAG outperforms existing RAG methods on multi-hop question answering (QA) tasks, achieving strong performance improvements of up to 20% on some datasets. It also demonstrates <strong>single-step multi-hop retrieval</strong> capabilities, allowing it to retrieve all supporting passages for a query in a single step.",
