    {
      "title": "Why It Matters",
      "content": "HippoRAG's ability to perform single-step multi-hop retrieval and its <strong>neurobiologically inspired design</strong> make it a promising approach for long-term memory in large language models. Its potential applications include <strong>path-finding multi-hop QA</strong>, where it can leverage its web of associations to determine relevant passages.",
